oposals... and screened_sources\".\nSo the root object should be `{ \"chapter_proposals\": [...], \"screened_sources\": [...] }`.\n\nLet's verify the `source_routing` handles.\nI need to extract the `source_handle` for P0311 and P0407 from the input list.\nP0311: \"P0311\"\nP0407: \"P0407\"\nI will use these in `excluded_source_handles`.\n\nI will also check if there are any other sources that are clearly out of scope.\nP0307 is about yeast-based delivery of checkpoint inhibitors (haPD-1), not exactly microbiome modulation of ICI, but it involves microbiome reshaping. It's borderline. The abstract says \"accompanied by gut microbiota reshaping\". It might be more about the delivery system. I will keep it as a novel strategy example but note the limitation.\nP0445 is about affordable immunotherapy, mentions microbiome. Keep.\nP0500 is about bariatric surgery. Keep.\n\nOkay, ready to write.",
